'''King Bacha XV International Airport''' ([[wikipedia:IATA airport code|BATA]]: '''BYL''' - '''ⰁⰊⰄ'''; [[wikipedia:ICAO airport code|BCAO]]: '''QBYL''' - '''ⰢⰁⰊⰄ''') is the primary international airport serving [[Zhol]] and its surrounding metropolitan area. BYL airport is located ## kilometers southwest of [[Zhol]], in the town of [[TBD]]. It is named after the former [[King of Qym]], [[Bacha XV of Qym|Bacha XV]]. 

BYL is the primary hub of [[Qymaja Malduk Ryba]], and it is home to the airline's corporate headquarters. 

